Yes.

271
00:18:34,938 --> 00:18:37,438
That time, it was on an escalator.

272
00:18:37,521 --> 00:18:39,063
A station staff caught me.

273
00:18:40,563 --> 00:18:43,105
Since I was job hunting at the time,

274
00:18:43,605 --> 00:18:47,938
my lawyer asked the victim
to take my future into consideration.

275
00:18:48,021 --> 00:18:50,271
The settlement was paid,
and the case was dropped.

276
00:18:52,021 --> 00:18:55,688
After that, I stopped for a while.

277
00:18:57,146 --> 00:18:58,730
But with work stress

278
00:18:59,605 --> 00:19:02,730
and smartphones making it easy
to take clear pictures…

279
00:19:14,521 --> 00:19:18,313
How many times have you done it so far?

280
00:19:20,688 --> 00:19:23,438
I've never really kept track.

281
00:19:23,938 --> 00:19:26,438
Maybe two or three times a week.

282
00:19:27,813 --> 00:19:32,355
Even with the breaks I've taken,
it's been about 15 years.

283
00:19:36,646 --> 00:19:38,646
Two thousand one hundred sixty.

284
00:19:39,646 --> 00:19:42,313
After doing it for all those years,

285
00:19:42,396 --> 00:19:44,730
this is your second arrest.

286
00:19:45,355 --> 00:19:46,355
Yes.

287
00:19:46,896 --> 00:19:50,730
This time, I thought she wanted
to be photographed.

288
00:19:55,938 --> 00:19:58,563
<i>She came over</i>
<i>and stood right in front of me.</i>

289
00:20:21,855 --> 00:20:24,938
<i>It seemed like she noticed</i>
<i>I was taking photos,</i>

290
00:20:25,021 --> 00:20:26,896
<i>but she didn't seem to mind.</i>

291
00:20:28,355 --> 00:20:31,896
I figured she might be the type
who likes being photographed.

292
00:20:35,105 --> 00:20:36,813
In your case,

293
00:20:37,605 --> 00:20:40,605
it appears the station
is a trigger for you.

294
00:20:41,771 --> 00:20:47,063
Can you adjust your daily routine
to avoid going near stations for now?

295
00:20:47,146 --> 00:20:48,896
Maybe drive to work instead?

296
00:20:52,355 --> 00:20:54,646
Yes. I can do that.

297
00:20:54,730 --> 00:20:56,438
All right. Let's do that.

298
00:20:58,730 --> 00:21:01,938
This is your homework until next time.

299
00:21:05,563 --> 00:21:09,355
I'd like you to keep a record
of how you felt each day.

300
00:21:09,438 --> 00:21:12,855
If you got through the day peacefully,
use a blue sticker.

301
00:21:13,355 --> 00:21:18,146
If you couldn't stick to your routine
or felt upset, use a yellow sticker.

302
00:21:18,230 --> 00:21:23,063
If you felt the urge to do it again,
use a red sticker.

303
00:21:24,438 --> 00:21:27,355
Be honest when you record it.

304
00:21:28,105 --> 00:21:29,230
Okay.

305
00:21:34,605 --> 00:21:37,230
He thought she wanted to be photographed.

306
00:21:37,771 --> 00:21:40,063
That's a classic cognitive distortion.

307
00:21:40,563 --> 00:21:41,396
Yes.

308
00:21:41,896 --> 00:21:43,605
It's the same with groping.

309
00:21:43,688 --> 00:21:45,563
They see the victim freeze in fear

310
00:21:45,646 --> 00:21:49,855
and interpret it as them wanting it
because they didn't resist.

311
00:21:49,938 --> 00:21:52,771
How can he think that way?

312
00:21:52,855 --> 00:21:56,188
He knows he has to stop, but he can't.

313
00:21:56,271 --> 00:21:59,563
People can't live with that contradiction,
so they try to justify it.

314
00:22:00,063 --> 00:22:04,230
Deep down, he may also hold
male-chauvinistic beliefs

315
00:22:04,313 --> 00:22:07,313
that women should accept
men's sexual desires.

316
00:22:07,396 --> 00:22:09,980
It's like he views women as objects.

317
00:22:10,063 --> 00:22:13,605
He did say he only took photos
up their skirts, not their faces.

318
00:22:13,688 --> 00:22:16,688
He chooses his targets
based on how they look from behind.

319
00:22:16,771 --> 00:22:19,771
It's like he doesn't even
see them as people anymore.

320
00:22:21,271 --> 00:22:23,021
What should we do?

321
00:22:24,730 --> 00:22:27,938
First, we have to correct
his cognitive distortions,

322
00:22:28,021 --> 00:22:30,271
or we can't even begin his treatment.

323
00:22:37,063 --> 00:22:39,271
YUMI ICHINOSE

324
00:22:42,938 --> 00:22:45,355
Hey. Shouldn't you take that?

325
00:22:45,438 --> 00:22:47,521
It's fine. Our next client--

326
00:22:47,605 --> 00:22:49,480
By the way, this is delicious.

327
00:22:49,563 --> 00:22:50,605
Right?

328
00:22:50,688 --> 00:22:52,980
How do you know so much about sweets?

329
00:22:53,855 --> 00:22:57,313
Assuming old men don't know about sweets
is a cognitive distortion too.

330
00:22:57,396 --> 00:22:58,855
Isn't that just prejudice?

331
00:22:59,813 --> 00:23:01,021
It is.

332
00:23:02,021 --> 00:23:04,146
But when you spend time
with younger students,

333
00:23:04,230 --> 00:23:06,563
you naturally pick up on these things.

334
00:23:06,646 --> 00:23:08,521
Wow. Which place has the best--

335
00:23:08,605 --> 00:23:10,688
Actually, I'm going to call them back.

336
00:23:13,063 --> 00:23:15,188
I'm sorry about the other day.

337
00:23:19,063 --> 00:23:21,271
I shouldn't have pushed you to talk

338
00:23:21,355 --> 00:23:23,605
about something you weren't
comfortable with.

339
00:23:29,063 --> 00:23:30,271
Do you remember?

340
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:33,105
In middle school,

341
00:23:33,896 --> 00:23:36,896
I was secretly photographed.

342
00:23:40,980 --> 00:23:42,313
<i>Back then,</i>

343
00:23:43,271 --> 00:23:45,271
<i>you didn't ask me anything.</i>

344
00:23:46,313 --> 00:23:48,313
<i>You just stayed by my side.</i>

345
00:23:50,688 --> 00:23:53,105
You said, "Talk to me when you're ready."

346
00:23:54,938 --> 00:23:56,896
"Whether anything's happened or not,

347
00:23:58,396 --> 00:24:00,813
I'll listen whenever you want to talk."

348
00:24:04,521 --> 00:24:06,396
Those words really saved me.

349
00:24:09,855 --> 00:24:11,730
So I'll wait too.

350
00:24:11,813 --> 00:24:16,771
I'll wait until you're ready
to talk about it.

351
00:24:23,938 --> 00:24:25,188
Thank you.

352
00:24:47,355 --> 00:24:48,605
Actually,

353
00:24:49,105 --> 00:24:53,313
I'm treating a client who's addicted
to photo voyeurism right now.

354
00:24:56,980 --> 00:24:58,063
I was also

355
00:24:59,980 --> 00:25:03,396
thinking about what happened back then.

356
00:25:08,230 --> 00:25:12,271
I don't want anyone else to experience

357
00:25:13,188 --> 00:25:15,021
what you went through.

358
00:25:19,771 --> 00:25:20,771
But

359
00:25:22,605 --> 00:25:26,813
he doesn't realize there are victims.

360
00:25:27,396 --> 00:25:30,480
He doesn't feel like he's hurt anyone.

361
00:25:33,230 --> 00:25:34,896
I don't know what to do.

362
00:25:38,938 --> 00:25:40,396
Shimotori.

363
00:25:42,230 --> 00:25:43,271
What if

364
00:25:43,980 --> 00:25:48,146
he could hear from the people
who have been hurt?

365
00:25:51,896 --> 00:25:53,730
FACT-FINDING RECORD ON STAFF CONDUCT

366
00:25:56,855 --> 00:26:00,146
July 31st, Arakawa Station.

367
00:26:02,896 --> 00:26:05,646
Were you arrested
for upskirting, Mr. Ikeuchi?

368
00:26:07,771 --> 00:26:08,771
Huh?

369
00:26:08,855 --> 00:26:12,813
Someone from the company
happened to witness it.

370
00:26:13,688 --> 00:26:15,688
It's become the talk of the office.

371
00:26:21,896 --> 00:26:22,896
Yes, I was.

372
00:26:28,105 --> 00:26:31,813
We'd like you to stay home
while we decide on disciplinary action.

373
00:27:57,980 --> 00:28:00,521
Thank you for calling me.

374
00:28:03,688 --> 00:28:04,688
I…

375
00:28:05,313 --> 00:28:06,980
I don't care anymore.

376
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:12,146
I don't even know why
I should keep getting treatment.

377
00:28:16,521 --> 00:28:18,271
When I stop upskirting,

378
00:28:20,063 --> 00:28:22,563
I feel like I've lost my reason to live.

379
00:28:25,188 --> 00:28:28,605
That's what addiction is.

380
00:28:31,813 --> 00:28:32,813
But

381
00:28:33,396 --> 00:28:37,563
you were able to seek help on your own.

382
00:28:39,313 --> 00:28:42,938
That's why I thanked you for calling me.

383
00:28:47,146 --> 00:28:48,646
So you'll be okay.

384
00:28:49,521 --> 00:28:54,521
Deep down, I know you want to quit.

385
00:28:58,563 --> 00:29:00,855
Your prescription is ready.

386
00:29:01,896 --> 00:29:05,063
This may be very difficult for you.

387
00:29:08,563 --> 00:29:11,188
Are you ready for it?

388
00:29:17,188 --> 00:29:18,188
Yes.

389
00:29:19,230 --> 00:29:20,521
Please help me.

390
00:29:30,355 --> 00:29:33,438
If you want to stop,
please tell me anytime.

391
00:29:34,355 --> 00:29:35,355
Okay.

392
00:29:59,938 --> 00:30:03,855
Thank you for agreeing
to this interview today.

393
00:30:04,355 --> 00:30:05,355
Not at all.

394
00:30:07,105 --> 00:30:08,480
Let's get started.

395
00:30:26,271 --> 00:30:27,813
I see.

396
00:30:29,438 --> 00:30:31,855
I've told my family
about what happened at work.

397
00:30:33,355 --> 00:30:36,646
This time, I'm determined to quit.

398
00:30:37,813 --> 00:30:38,813
That's why I'm…

399
00:30:41,730 --> 00:30:44,188
You're undergoing treatment?

400
00:30:45,146 --> 00:30:47,021
Yes. That's right.

401
00:30:48,730 --> 00:30:50,521
Thank you.

402
00:30:51,896 --> 00:30:58,355
Finally, would you like to watch
the footage we mentioned earlier?

403
00:31:06,313 --> 00:31:07,313
Yes.

404
00:31:07,896 --> 00:31:09,063
Please.

405
00:31:10,813 --> 00:31:12,063
All right.

406
00:31:17,230 --> 00:31:19,938
These are people
who heard about this interview

407
00:31:20,730 --> 00:31:25,146
and wanted to share their own experiences.

408
00:31:27,605 --> 00:31:30,438
We filmed them for today.

409
00:31:34,938 --> 00:31:39,021
<i>Just to confirm, may we show your face?</i>

410
00:31:40,646 --> 00:31:41,480
<i>Yes.</i>

411
00:31:42,730 --> 00:31:44,230
<i>Thank you.</i>

412
00:31:45,063 --> 00:31:47,813
<i>May we show your face?</i>

413
00:31:47,896 --> 00:31:48,896
<i>Yes.</i>

414
00:31:50,146 --> 00:31:51,771
<i>Thank you.</i>

415
00:31:54,021 --> 00:31:56,688
<i>You only need to answer</i>
<i>what you're comfortable sharing.</i>

416
00:31:57,188 --> 00:32:00,688
<i>Could you tell us about what happened?</i>

417
00:32:04,188 --> 00:32:07,938
<i>I was upskirted on a train.</i>

418
00:32:11,063 --> 00:32:12,146
<i>Even now,</i>

419
00:32:13,146 --> 00:32:15,271
<i>I'm too scared to take the train.</i>

420
00:32:18,813 --> 00:32:19,980
<i>Going to crowded places,</i>

421
00:32:21,771 --> 00:32:24,063
<i>or even just seeing a train,</i>

422
00:32:25,521 --> 00:32:27,355
<i>makes me remember that time.</i>

423
00:32:29,563 --> 00:32:31,563
<i>And I freeze up.</i>

424
00:32:38,563 --> 00:32:39,646
<i>Last year,</i>

425
00:32:40,355 --> 00:32:42,771
<i>I went to an outdoor hot spring</i>
<i>with my family.</i>

426
00:32:44,563 --> 00:32:47,771
<i>I made eye contact with a man</i>

427
00:32:49,188 --> 00:32:50,813
<i>who was filming me.</i>

428
00:32:52,855 --> 00:32:55,063
<i>I thought, "Just because I'm a woman,</i>

429
00:32:55,563 --> 00:32:58,563
<i>I still have to go through this</i>
<i>even at this age?"</i>

430
00:33:00,271 --> 00:33:03,355
<i>I also felt sorry for my daughter.</i>

431
00:33:08,563 --> 00:33:14,105
<i>I was secretly photographed</i>
<i>in the locker room and restroom at work.</i>

432
00:33:14,188 --> 00:33:16,855
<i>The photos were posted online.</i>

433
00:33:18,896 --> 00:33:23,813
<i>Whenever a man comes near me,</i>
<i>I'm afraid he might do the same thing,</i>

434
00:33:23,896 --> 00:33:27,355
<i>or that he's seen those photos of me.</i>

435
00:33:28,271 --> 00:33:30,355
<i>I couldn't even leave my house.</i>

436
00:33:31,271 --> 00:33:32,480
<i>And now…</i>

437
00:33:39,271 --> 00:33:41,146
<i>I'm seeing a doctor</i>

438
00:33:42,438 --> 00:33:44,563
<i>and taking medication.</i>

439
00:33:46,563 --> 00:33:50,605
<i>Is there anything you'd like to say</i>
<i>to those engaging in voyeurism</i>

440
00:33:50,688 --> 00:33:52,646
<i>who are watching this now?</i>

441
00:33:56,271 --> 00:33:59,313
<i>I'd like to ask them, "Why me?"</i>

442
00:34:01,396 --> 00:34:05,605
<i>Did I do something wrong?</i>

443
00:34:09,105 --> 00:34:10,521
<i>Am I to blame</i>

444
00:34:11,771 --> 00:34:13,896
<i>for being a woman?</i>

445
00:34:32,438 --> 00:34:34,605
Actually, in the past, I…

446
00:34:56,438 --> 00:34:57,855
In the past,

447
00:34:58,563 --> 00:35:00,563
I was also secretly photographed.

448
00:35:01,230 --> 00:35:02,980
That's crazy!

449
00:35:03,063 --> 00:35:04,396
<i>In middle school…</i>

450
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,313
-Send it.
-Idiot!

451
00:35:05,396 --> 00:35:06,980
<i>…some boys in my class</i>

452
00:35:07,063 --> 00:35:09,688
<i>took photos of me and shared them around.</i>

453
00:35:11,146 --> 00:35:14,355
That alone was shocking, but…

454
00:35:17,313 --> 00:35:20,521
Teenage boys are idiots, you know?

455
00:35:20,605 --> 00:35:22,563
But they've got entrance exams coming up.

456
00:35:23,146 --> 00:35:24,396
Can you let this slide?

457
00:35:28,355 --> 00:35:29,271
Come on.

458
00:35:29,355 --> 00:35:31,688
Look on the bright side, Ichinose!

459
00:35:31,771 --> 00:35:34,438
This just means you're prettier
than the other girls.

460
00:35:35,063 --> 00:35:39,230
<i>My homeroom teacher's words</i>
<i>deeply hurt me.</i>

461
00:35:39,730 --> 00:35:43,230
And isn't your skirt shorter
than the dress code?

462
00:35:43,313 --> 00:35:46,105
It's like you're asking
for your picture to be taken.

463
00:35:47,021 --> 00:35:48,021
<i>That day…</i>

464
00:35:48,105 --> 00:35:49,188
I'll lecture them.

465
00:35:49,271 --> 00:35:51,021
<i>…my dignity and my voice</i>

466
00:35:51,771 --> 00:35:53,605
<i>were taken from me at the same time.</i>

467
00:35:57,563 --> 00:35:59,563
Just like the women in this video.

468
00:36:06,021 --> 00:36:08,355
Every single victim

469
00:36:08,938 --> 00:36:11,688
has a face and a voice.

470
00:36:17,313 --> 00:36:21,021
They are human beings
with their own will and identity.

471
00:36:24,355 --> 00:36:26,188
Please don't ever

472
00:36:27,230 --> 00:36:28,896
forget that.

473
00:36:54,105 --> 00:36:55,521
I'm sorry.

474
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,896
I'm sorry.

475
00:37:07,896 --> 00:37:10,730
Do you think he'll be able to quit?

476
00:37:13,355 --> 00:37:16,271
There's no complete cure for addiction.

477
00:37:17,105 --> 00:37:18,105
What?

478
00:37:19,188 --> 00:37:22,021
All you can do is face
the harm you've caused

479
00:37:22,105 --> 00:37:26,646
and keep working to stay clean
for the rest of your life.

480
00:37:28,105 --> 00:37:29,646
I see.

481
00:37:30,688 --> 00:37:33,771
So you can never really say, "I've quit."

482
00:37:34,896 --> 00:37:37,980
You just keep adding days
where you didn't do it.

483
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:43,021
And that's why we're here
to help them do that.

484
00:37:47,980 --> 00:37:49,313
I realized something today.

485
00:37:50,896 --> 00:37:54,646
My voice was taken from me twice.

486
00:37:56,271 --> 00:37:58,438
The first time was in middle school.

487
00:37:59,438 --> 00:38:02,355
The second time was
when I became a reporter

488
00:38:02,438 --> 00:38:06,063
and was expected to play a certain role
as a weather presenter.

489
00:38:08,855 --> 00:38:10,813
But I'm glad I got to speak up today

490
00:38:12,021 --> 00:38:14,355
in my own voice and in my own words.

491
00:38:15,730 --> 00:38:20,396
It reminded me that
this was the kind of reporter

492
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,688
I wanted to become.

493
00:38:26,188 --> 00:38:27,396
All right.

494
00:38:27,896 --> 00:38:30,396
I'm gonna get this feature approved!

495
00:38:42,855 --> 00:38:44,438
About the other day…

496
00:38:47,271 --> 00:38:48,271
Sorry.

497
00:38:49,021 --> 00:38:52,521
I know I said I'd wait
until you were ready to talk about it.

498
00:38:54,313 --> 00:38:56,021
Can I just ask you one thing?

499
00:38:59,188 --> 00:39:00,021
Sure.

500
00:39:04,188 --> 00:39:06,271
When you said you can't do it…

501
00:39:08,271 --> 00:39:09,855
did you mean "not yet"?

502
00:39:24,688 --> 00:39:25,730
I see.

503
00:39:27,355 --> 00:39:28,396
I'm glad to hear that.

504
00:39:36,480 --> 00:39:37,563
I…

505
00:39:38,605 --> 00:39:40,521
I like you after all.

506
00:39:43,271 --> 00:39:44,188
So

507
00:39:45,813 --> 00:39:47,438
my answer is yes.

508
00:39:52,813 --> 00:39:54,021
Thank you.

509
00:40:00,271 --> 00:40:01,271
Then…

510
00:40:57,646 --> 00:40:59,563
Looks like they're having fun.

511
00:41:24,688 --> 00:41:27,521
Shit. Don't look this way, damn it!

512
00:43:29,105 --> 00:43:31,021
Subtitle translation by: Yuki Asami

